sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / CI Pipeline
    participant CLI as llmdbenchmark CLI
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Harness as Benchmark Harness Pod<br/>StatefulSet 8080/TCP
    participant LLM as vLLM Inference Endpoint<br/>8000-8200/TCP
    participant PVC as Local PVC<br/>(Results Storage)
    participant GCS as Google Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant Prism as Prism Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    Note over User,HF: Flow 1: Benchmark Lifecycle (CLI-driven)

    User->>CLI: llmdbenchmark --spec <spec> --harness <harness>
    CLI->>HF: Verify model access<br/>Auth: Bearer HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>CLI: Model metadata / tokenizer config
    CLI->>CLI: Render Jinja2 templates → workspace
    CLI->>K8s: Apply deployment manifests<br/>Auth: kubeconfig / ServiceAccount
    K8s-->>CLI: Resources created (StatefulSet, Service, Route)

    Note over CLI,Harness: Standup Phase Complete

    CLI->>K8s: kubectl exec benchmark pod
    K8s->>Harness: Execute llm-d-benchmark.sh

    loop Retry (max 3 attempts)
        Harness->>LLM: Benchmark requests (inference-perf/guidellm/vllm-benchmark)<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
        LLM-->>Harness: Inference responses
    end

    Harness->>PVC: Write raw results
    Harness->>Harness: Post-run analysis (numpy, pandas, scipy)
    Harness->>PVC: Write Benchmark Report v0.2

    Note over CLI,GCS: Flow 2: Results Upload

    CLI->>GCS: Upload results<br/>Auth: Google ADC
    alt GCS direct fails
        CLI->>Prism: Upload via proxy fallback<br/>Auth: Bearer token (optional)
        Prism->>GCS: Forward to GCS<br/>Auth: Service credentials
    end

    Note over CLI,K8s: Flow 3: Teardown

    CLI->>K8s: Delete deployed resources<br/>Auth: kubeconfig
    K8s-->>CLI: Resources deleted

    Note over User,HF: Flow 4: Stack Discovery (separate tool)

    User->>CLI: llm-d-stack-discovery <endpoint-url>
    CLI->>K8s: Query Route / Gateway resources
    K8s-->>CLI: Route → Gateway → HTTPRoute → InferencePool → Pods
    CLI->>LLM: Health check discovered endpoint
    LLM-->>CLI: Health status
    CLI-->>User: Structured stack topology (JSON/YAML/Report)
